--header 'accept: application/json' \
--header 'Authorization: Bearer {{token}}'

### 9.9. Thống kê ví (ADMIN)
curl --location --request GET '{{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/stats' \
--header 'accept: application/json' \
--header 'Authorization: Bearer {{token}}'

### 9.10. Duyệt yêu cầu (ADMIN)
